{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 70473, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 50205, "uid": 75614, "type": 4, "title": "天子升星所需资源与升星方法", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1614170788, "updated_at": 1637855876, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1676088324, "last_at": 1676088324, "comment_count": 29, "status": 1, "summary": "7月23号：因为乱斗即将开启，奇缺进化素材，因此我推荐普通玩家在集齐五人pvp的全套T0装备后，将后续的pvp币全力用来购买高级进化素材【并且根据韩服经验，个人只推荐练三星场天子，除非后续策划开放更多", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 15, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 77642, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 6, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 70473, "content": "<div>7月23号：<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">因为乱斗即将开启，奇缺进化素材，因此我推荐普通玩家在集齐五人pvp的全套T0装备后，将后续的pvp币全力用来购买高级进化素材<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">【并且根据韩服经验，个人只推荐练三星场天子，除非后续策划开放更多的玛瑙与进化材料获取渠道】</span></span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>3.16号更新：补上评论大佬的补充：</div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: MicrosoftYaHei; font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; font-weight: bold;\">萌新在练级时，尽量选择能获取三星火属性进化石的关卡</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">【因为国际服活动赠送的四星满级进化史莱姆全为火属性，所以这一属性石头往往奇缺】</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">纯萌新请加群：</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">587777772</span><br></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">1.前言</span></p></div>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> 天命之子中，角色的升星，是提升队伍战斗力重要途径。活动前提前规划好进化材料与金币，可以有效防止出现进化资源不足的窘迫境况。同时，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">合理利用低星天子升星，在五星天子进化时，代替所需原生五星天子，可以极大节省原生五星天子。</span>【<span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\">小知识：天命之子游戏中，所有天子都可以通过满级升星的方式升到六星，而一开始就星级就为五颗星的天子，被称为原生五星（胎五）</span>】</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 由于目前点火版本的出现，点火石的制作天子材料限定为原生五星，因此就算已经+6溢出的天子也必须屯好，尽量节省原生五星的开销</span></span><br></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">请萌新不要在还魂或者五星天子升六星时，消耗原生五星天子！</span></span></span><br></span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">2.数据汇总</span></p></div></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1614172820903_25043517.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1614172820903_25043517.png\" alt=\"天子升星所需资源与升星方法\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">值得一提的是，合成高级进化素材非常耗费金币，因此建议萌新<span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">除非紧迫，不要强行使用低级进化素材合成高级材料</span>【<span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\">这也再次说明， 活动之前早点规划的重要性</span>】</span></div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></span></span></div><div><span><span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">3.结论</span></p></div></span></span></span><br></span></span></div><div><span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;首先，国际服进化素材来源获取<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">非常有限</span>，竞技场和wb【世界王】虽然有高级进化素材，但是都</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">不是最高优先级</span>【因为竞技场拥有目前版本可获取的最强装备，而wb点数需优先兑换天子和点火石】，主要获取场所为<span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\">每日副本</span>。因此，<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: MicrosoftYaHei; font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold;\">萌新在练级时，尽量选择能获取三星火属性进化石的关卡</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">【因为国际服活动赠送的四星满级进化史莱姆全为火属性，所以这一属性石头往往奇缺】</span></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">天命之子的主流队伍绝大部分都由</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">原生五星</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">组成</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;\">【国际服三星和四星大乱斗还未开放】，而由上图可知，</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\">四星升到五星，比三星升到五星，要少消耗进化素材</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;\">，因此建议萌新：</span></div></span><div><span></span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\">在周末双倍经验时，练四星天子到满级升星后，代替<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">原生</span></span>五星天子，来进行满级五星天子升六星</span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span><span><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, arial, &quot;hiragino sans gb&quot;, stheiti, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">——ID：xiaoxin</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, arial, &quot;hiragino sans gb&quot;, stheiti, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2021.2.24</font></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, arial, &quot;hiragino sans gb&quot;, stheiti, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: right;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, arial, &quot;hiragino sans gb&quot;, stheiti, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-indent: 0px; text-tr